flowchart TD
    Client["Клиент (Web / Mobile)"]
    GW["API Gateway (Traefik)"]
    Keycloak["Keycloak IAM"]
    
    subgraph Services ["Бизнес-сервисы"]
        Catalog["catalog-service<br/>(PostgreSQL + Redis)"]
        Order["order-service<br/>(PostgreSQL)"]
        Inventory["inventory-service<br/>(PostgreSQL + Redis)"]
        Payment["payment-service<br/>(PostgreSQL)"]
        Delivery["delivery-service<br/>(PostgreSQL)"]
    end

    Kafka[("Apache Kafka: Топики событий")]
    Bank["Платёжный шлюз (Банк)"]

    Client -->|HTTPS| GW
    GW -.->|Проверка JWT| Keycloak

    GW -->|GET /api/v1/products| Catalog
    GW -->|POST, GET /api/v1/orders| Order
    GW -->|GET /api/v1/shipments| Delivery
    Bank -->|Webhook POST /api/v1/payments| Payment

    Order -->|REST: GET /internal/v1/products| Catalog
    Order -->|REST: POST /internal/v1/reservations| Inventory
    Order -->|REST: POST /internal/v1/shipments/quote| Delivery
    Order -->|REST: POST /internal/v1/payments| Payment

    Order -.->|order.paid, order.cancelled| Kafka
    Payment -.->|payment.succeeded, payment.failed| Kafka
    Kafka -.->|События платежей| Order
    Kafka -.->|Списание / отмена брони| Inventory
    Kafka -.->|Создание наряда на доставку| Delivery
